==Abilities==
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Ducky Decoy|Cooldown Time = 25|Attack Cooldown Time = 6|Information = Jumps from one path to another, summons in one [[Mega Ducky]] which has its health reduced to 10,000 after departure. Becomes a [[Flying]] enemy during this ability.<br/>Starts on the yellow path, jumps to the orange path, then the green path, the blue path afterwards and goes back to the yellow path repeating the cycle.}}
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Ducky Stampede|Cooldown Time = 42.5|Attack Cooldown Time = 8|Information = Summons in 10 [[Elite Ducky|Elite Duckies]] and one [[Mega Ducky]]. The [[Mega Ducky]] has 100% [[Defense]].}}
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Ducky Reposition|Cooldown Time = 32.5|Attack Cooldown Time = 6|Information = Targets a tower with a beam and swaps it with a random tower.}}
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Ducky Discharge|Cooldown Time = 12.5|Attack Cooldown Time = 10|Information = Supercharges itself, dealing 30 damage to the base, stunning towers for 8 seconds and dealing over 100,000 damage to units. Can reduce the base's health to below zero. If a [[Bunny Sentry]] is on the map, it will launch itself at the '''Nerd Duck''', stopping the ability.}}
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Ducky Blast|Cooldown Time = 15|Attack Cooldown Time = 3|Information = Fires out multiple missiles at a minimum of five targets, applying a 30% [[Fatigue Debuff]] (~23.07% increase) to towers for 8 seconds. As for units, it deals no damage and does not affect them in any way.}}
{{EnemyAbility|Ability Title = Nerd Rage|Cooldown Time = 52.5|Attack Cooldown Time = 6|Image = NerdDuckEnragedSlam.gif|Information = Powers up its left arm and slams the ground, stunning towers for 6 seconds and dealing 1,500 damage to units.}}
</center>
</div>
</div>
